        {
          "text": " Kocoito kinyek idiotuŋanan aŋatar yes kanuka aminacoa ka aiŋal naatai, kwape ejaatar iponesio luka ituŋa, kwape ejaatar nugeet nuka akwapin, kwabo mere kwape ejaar Kristo, ",
