                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yes da lukitwakito kotoma aibucanareta, ka amamus akepio naka awatekus, abu Edeke koinak yes aijar nepepe kaŋes, kedau ŋesi aisioni oni aibucanaretawok kere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
